OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 1,500 sign petition
OL,4,Aagainst 1,500 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,500 people have signed a
OL,7,Fpetition opposing plans for up to 1,500
OL,8,Fhomes on land in Kent.
OL,10,FThe site between Sevenoaks and Otford
OL,11,Fhas been earmarked for development in
OL,12,FSevenoaks District Council's emerging
OL,13,FLocal Plan, a blueprint for where
OL,14,Fhousing and infrastructure could be
OL,15,Fbuilt over the next 15 years.
OL,17,FCampaigners say the housing targets in
OL,18,Fthe plan are "unrealistic and
OL,19,Finappropriate".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
