OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 1,500 sign petition
OL,4,Aagainst 1,500 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Sevenoaks District
OL,7,FCouncil said the developers, Fairfax,
OL,8,Fput the site forward for housing and it
OL,9,Fwould consider the petition. Fairfax
OL,10,Fsaid it was committed to engaging with
OL,11,Fresidents.
